# T_SCRR: the login screen opened twice in one run.  The first time it
# sends VER for the version in its title; the second shows the same
# title without asking again.  Both log in as ADMIN.  Then the home
# screen on a PC whose clock was never set (1980-01-01): below the date,
# the warning to set it with DATE.
S LOGIN1
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T secret1
K ENTER
S LOGIN2
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T secret1
K ENTER
S OLDDATE
K F3
T Y
